{"c":[{"name":"20260912T171208Z-73d07cf3ecfc8407","text":"always-tdd out-of-scope is repository bootstrap (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, copied init), not agent-facing prompts; product rules with evals would still be TDD (#123 rework).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T175124Z-ed6de308b249777f","text":"L4 Execution Order: the checklist is always a serial-safe walk (one-at-a-time never needs a later milestone); when work is not a line, the flowchart records parallel sets. Follow the list or the DAG; they must agree so a mid-project switch does not conflict.","type":"note"}]}
